    },
    "Purrdr Plus Is On" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已開通 Purrdr Plus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr Plus belongs to your Purrdr member account. Sign in, and your purchase is added automatically." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr Plus 屬於你的 Purrdr 會員。登入後，你的購買項目會自動加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr Plus · Active" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr Plus・已開通"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr adds a small helper to each host you turn on. When an agent needs you, this device gets a notification. Notifications show only the workspace name, never what the agent said. On Windows hosts, notifications may be delayed." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會在你開啟的每台主機加裝一個小幫手。Agent 需要你時，這支裝置會收到通知。通知只顯示 Workspace 名稱，絕不包含 Agent 說的內容。Windows 主機的通知可能會延遲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr can’t safely change Claude Code’s settings on this host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 無法安全地更改這台主機上 Claude Code 的設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr can’t safely update the notes file on this host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 無法安全地更新這台主機上的註記檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr changes the Claude Code status line on %@ so it saves plan usage. You can turn it off and restore the original anytime." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會修改 %@ 上 Claude Code 的 status line,讓它存下方案用量。隨時可以關閉並還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr couldn’t read Codex’s answer. Updating Codex on the host may help." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 看不懂 Codex 的回應。更新主機上的 Codex 或許有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr doesn’t open files in this location." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 不開啟這個位置的檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr host service %@ is ready for %@ (now %@). Run the install command on the host once; after that it updates itself." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$@ 有新版的主機服務 %1$@(目前 %3$@)。請在那台主機執行一次下面的安裝指令，之後它會自己更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr host service %@ is ready for %@. To update now, run this on the host:" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$@ 有新版的主機服務 %1$@。要立刻更新，請在那台主機執行："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr reads this host’s colors and adds a small note file, signed in as %@. It never changes your settings. Turning this off removes the file." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會讀取這台主機的配色並新增一個小說明檔(以帳號 %@)。不會更動你的設定;關閉後會移除這個檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr stopped because this host no longer looks like the one you trusted before. This happens if it was reinstalled or reset, and also if someone is intercepting the connection. If you didn’t reinstall or reset it, don’t connect.\n\nIf you did, delete this host and add it again.\n\nKey now:\n%@\n\nKey you trusted:\n%@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 已停止連線，因為這台主機看起來不是你之前信任的那一台。主機重灌或重設過會這樣，有人攔截連線也會。如果你沒有重灌或重設過，請不要連線。\n\n如果有，請刪除這台主機再重新新增。\n\n現在的指紋：\n%@\n\n你先前信任的指紋：\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr supports macOS, Linux, and Windows hosts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 支援 macOS、Linux 與 Windows 主機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr tests the connection before saving the host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會先測試連線，再儲存主機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr updates Claude Code’s notes file on this host when you act on a note. Undo puts back what Purrdr changed and asks again next time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "對註記採取動作時，Purrdr 會更新這台主機上 Claude Code 的註記檔。復原會還原 Purrdr 改過的內容，下次會再詢問。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr will add a small Codex launcher on this host, as “%@”. It changes nothing else. You can turn it off here at any time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會以「%@」在這台主機加入一個小型 Codex 啟動器，不會更動其他東西。你隨時可以在這裡關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr will install a small notification helper on this host, as %@. Turning notifications off removes only this device; the helper is removed when the last device turns off." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會以 %@ 身分在這台主機安裝一個小型通知幫手。關閉通知只會移除這支裝置；最後一支裝置關閉時才會移除幫手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr will warn you if this host’s identity ever changes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
